{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WwbZ8E-XPTdfnSQzSvvrGg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:18.589058+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WwbZ8E-XPTdfnSQzSvvrGg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/31dAP9RABrOGJmTqIwrnC3ZdwRcZDmKkrFh4NT4Ia5j4LTABwp08SficogsIqibjFxXsC9ma6lwRWwwl8nejrRgA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/31dAP9RABrOGJmTqIwrnC3ZdwRcZDmKkZwQjIsMLTcANnsI87EyfEW9tWAJsavqdg5KP3awnm89ublbtlIJWbA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>广州医科大学附属妇女</span></span><span><span>儿童医疗</span></span><span><span>中心</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>（广州市妇女儿童医疗中心）</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>暑期研学体验营开始报名啦！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>欢迎2026年全日制普通高等学校</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>应届优秀本科毕业生报名体验</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>一起阅读全文 查看详情👇</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>广州医科大学附属妇女</span><span>儿童医疗</span><span>中心</span><span><span>是华南地区规模最大的一所集医疗、预防、保健、康复、科研、教学为一体的公立三级甲等妇女儿童专科医院，</span></span><span>是国家儿童区域医疗中心（中南</span><span>）</span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>第二批国家区域医疗中心建设输出单位、全国现代医院管理制度试点单位、广东省高水平医院第二批重点建设医院，</span></span><span>拥有国家临床重点专科6个，省临床重点专科10个</span><span>。</span><span>2023年全国综合排名获评A+等级，儿外科专科位列全国第5名、儿内科位列全国第7名、罕见病位列全国第8名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>中心核定床位数2400张。2024年，门急诊量519万人次，出院量17万人次，手术量8.4万人次，分娩量3.2万人次。共设有66个专科，实现妇幼健康全链条、高质量诊疗服务，尤其在低龄低体重先心手术，儿童罕见病精准诊断与治疗、造血干细胞移植治疗、遗传病早期产前诊断、胎儿医学等疑难危重症诊治方面具有雄厚实力。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>现有职工4900余人，各类高层次人才233人。博士生导师72人，硕士生导师315人。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>为搭建全国各高校优秀医学本科生之间学习交流的平台，增强全国优秀大学对中心的全面深入了解，深化跨校学科沟通与学术交融，中心将</span></span><span><span>于</span></span><span>8月5日-7日在广州开展“优秀大学生暑期研学体验营活动”</span><span><span>，现面向全国开放公开报名渠道，欢迎来自全国高校符合条件的本科生踊跃参加。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>现将有关通知事项予以公布。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>一、招募对象、专业和计划</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qwX5WoJ9j1naYCxeq20eqHcHFrqiaKBgViabOLr6OBIQtia5GdWYAPFOfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qoicia9Po3tuBA76r9Hp0HHHV2ajDctZlLUVjiad10UfzYUhVddrwVERtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>（一）招募对象</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>2026年全日制普通高等学校应届优秀本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（二）营员专业</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>主要针对医学相关专业，包括但不限于临床医学、基础医学、公共卫生、医学检验、生物医学工程、药学等专业。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（三）招募计划</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>拟招募30-50名营员，视报名情况和工作安排开营。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qwX5WoJ9j1naYCxeq20eqHcHFrqiaKBgViabOLr6OBIQtia5GdWYAPFOfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qoicia9Po3tuBA76r9Hp0HHHV2ajDctZlLUVjiad10UfzYUhVddrwVERtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.热爱社会主义祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，具有良好的品行，无违法违纪行为。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.学习成绩优秀，本科阶段总成绩排名在就读专业同年级学生中名列前茅（或在其它方面有突出表现），具备扎实的专业基础知识；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.具备较强的科研能力和创新潜力，曾参与科研项目、发表过相关论文、申请专利或获得科研及临床技能竞赛奖项者优先；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.英语水平良好，具备基本的英语交流能力：全国大学英语四级考试（CET-4）成绩≥500分，或六级考试（CET-6）成绩≥440分，或与之相当的水平；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.身心健康，能够全程参与体验营活动，并遵守医院的相关规章制度。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qwX5WoJ9j1naYCxeq20eqHcHFrqiaKBgViabOLr6OBIQtia5GdWYAPFOfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qoicia9Po3tuBA76r9Hp0HHHV2ajDctZlLUVjiad10UfzYUhVddrwVERtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.提交申请</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>申请人可在即日起至7月25日17:00前，将电子版申请材料提交至医院指定邮箱：fejx@gwcmc.org；</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮件标题格式为：“优秀大学生研学体验营申请-姓名-所在学校”。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>2.初审筛选</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>审核小组对申请材料进行初步筛选，结合学习成绩、科研经历等材料综合评定，确定入围名单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审结果将通过邮件通知入围的申请人。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>3.复审确认</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>入围的申请人需在规定时间内回复确认是否参加(具体见邮件)，并提供补充材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>未在规定时间内回复视为自动放弃资格，名额将顺延至候补名单中的申请人。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>四、需提交的报名材料</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qwX5WoJ9j1naYCxeq20eqHcHFrqiaKBgViabOLr6OBIQtia5GdWYAPFOfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qoicia9Po3tuBA76r9Hp0HHHV2ajDctZlLUVjiad10UfzYUhVddrwVERtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>请将以下材料按顺序扫描成一个PDF文档上传，文件名为“大学生研学体验营申请-xx大学-姓名-xx专业”。文件名说明：xx大学指申请人本科就读学校，xx专业指申请人本科就读专业。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>1.研学体验营报名申请表（附件1）</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.身份证（双面）</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学生证（有个人信息的所有页面）</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.《教育部学籍在线验证报告》</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.本科阶段成绩单盖章原件及成绩排名证明</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.外语水平证明扫描版（四六级或雅思托福证书等）</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.其他证明材料（个人获奖证书、代表作品等）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>五、活动初步安排</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qwX5WoJ9j1naYCxeq20eqHcHFrqiaKBgViabOLr6OBIQtia5GdWYAPFOfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qoicia9Po3tuBA76r9Hp0HHHV2ajDctZlLUVjiad10UfzYUhVddrwVERtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>（一）活动形式</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>采用线下的活动方式。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（二）报到地址</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>广州医科大学附属妇女儿童医疗中心珠江新城院区（广州市天河区金穗路9号）</span></span></p><section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（三）活动方案</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>初步活动方案如下，具体安排如有调整，请以后续通知为准。</span></span></p></section><table><tbody><tr><th><span><span>日期</span></span></th><th><span><span>时间</span></span></th><th><span><span>活动安排</span></span></th></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>8月5日</span></span></td><td><span><span>上</span></span><span><span>午</span></span></td><td><span><span>学员前往报到</span></span><span><span>地</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>下午</span></span></td><td><span><span>开营仪式</span></span></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>8月6日</span></span></td><td><span><span>上午</span></span></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>研学活动，学科交流</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>下午</span></span></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>8月7日</span></span></td><td><span><span>上午</span></span></td><td><p><span><span>结营仪式</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>下午</span></span></td><td><span><span>营员返程</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>六、其他说明</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qwX5WoJ9j1naYCxeq20eqHcHFrqiaKBgViabOLr6OBIQtia5GdWYAPFOfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qoicia9Po3tuBA76r9Hp0HHHV2ajDctZlLUVjiad10UfzYUhVddrwVERtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>(一)本次研学体验营不收取任何费用。中心将统一安排营期用餐及住宿。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(二)营员从报名者中选拔，入营后需全程参与相关活动，遵守医院暑期研学体验营的相关规定，按照统一安排参加各项活动。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(三)申请人所提供的的各种信息和材料务必真实有效，如有不实、弄虚作假，一经查实，中心将取消其营员资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(四)入营报到时，请携带身份证、学生证、申请材料及相关证明材料原件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(五)外地院校营员请自行预定往返火车票，中心将资助外地营员往返交通费（从目前就读大学所在地至广州，报销标准为火车硬座、硬卧，高铁/动车二等座或汽车票、长途客车、船票（三等舱）等按照票价给予报销；飞机票报销价格≤高铁（动车）二等座报销价格，则按照飞机票价格给予报销。需出示票根，实报实销，超出部分营员自行承担）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(六)中心为参营人员购买体验营活动期间人身意外伤害保险。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(七)营员在营期间发生的医疗费用及因个人行为导致的意外事故，由学员本人或其派出单位承担。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(八)中途退营营员，不享受以上待遇。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>七、联系方式</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qwX5WoJ9j1naYCxeq20eqHcHFrqiaKBgViabOLr6OBIQtia5GdWYAPFOfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mbp1EphFrZGytnbwYLILsBJDRydC7ia1qoicia9Po3tuBA76r9Hp0HHHV2ajDctZlLUVjiad10UfzYUhVddrwVERtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>中心官网：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>https://www.gzfezx.com/</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>020-38367273 黄老师；020-38367837 卫老师</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>fejx@gwcmc.org</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><strong><span><br/></span></strong></section><section><strong><span><span>研学体验营报名申请表</span></span><span><span><span>👇</span></span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>附件1：广州医科大学附属妇女儿童医疗中心2025年全国优秀大学生暑期研学体验营报名申请表</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"夏令营二维码.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"